        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Tutorial Goals",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Model vessels and environmental loads in 6 DOF.",
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Use state-of-the-art hydrodynamic codes to compute model parameters: added mass, potential damping, 1st and 2nd-order wave loads.",
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Derive control plant models by postprocessing data from hydrodynamic codes (Matlab GNC toolbox).",
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Use system identification to fit hydrodynamic data to state-space models.",
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Add viscous effects/manoeuvring terms.",
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Time-domain simulation in Matlab Simulink.",
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "03/09/2007",
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
